# CMake and tests

## gameLib sources

Every new implementation `.cpp` under `src/` must be added to the `gameLib` source list in `src/CMakeLists.txt`. Omitting it means the file never compiles.

Executable is `game` (`src/main.cpp`); link only against `gameLib` + SFML as already set up.

## Tests (Debug only)

```sh
cmake --preset debug
cmake --build --preset debug --target build_ut
ctest --preset debug
```

- Unit tests: `tests/unit_tests/<area>/` (e.g. `GameControllerTest.cpp`)
- Mocks: `tests/mocks/<area>/`
- Register with `add_unit_test(...)` in `tests/unit_tests/CMakeLists.txt`
- Prefer `StrictMock`, fixture names like `*Should`, mirror `src/` layout

When changing controllers or managers, update or add unit tests and mocks in the matching folders.
